    "canonical_ref": "Anast.EpJoh.9.s5",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "In any case I beg you to be assured of this, that he is so completely separate from all part or lot with us, that I neither know nor wish to know either what he is doing or where he is living.",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
